    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on exploration and puzzle-solving, drawing players into a tense and immersive atmosphere. <strong><i>Chalet</i></strong> is a <u>first-person horror exploration game</u> with <u>escape-room elements</u>. The average completion time is around 1 to 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a stranded traveler whose car breaks down after a sudden accident on a remote forest road. Alone and uncertain, you stumble upon an old chalet hidden deep in the woods. What seems like a place of refuge quickly reveals itself to be full of strange occurrences and unsettling secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the rooms of the chalet, uncover scattered notes that reveal the story of its mysterious inhabitants, and find hidden clues to aid your progress. Solve puzzles involving switches, codes, and hidden mechanisms to unlock new areas. Throughout your journey, a dark presence lingers in the , creating moments of tension and unexpected scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With atmospheric visuals, ambient sound design, and a narrative told through the discovered notes, Chalet invites players to piece together its haunting story and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on exploration and puzzle-solving, drawing players into a tense and immersive atmosphere. <strong><i>Chalet</i></strong> is a <u>first-person horror exploration game</u> with <u>escape-room elements</u>. The average completion time is around 1 to 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a stranded traveler whose car breaks down after a sudden accident on a remote forest road. Alone and uncertain, you stumble upon an old chalet hidden deep in the woods. What seems like a place of refuge quickly reveals itself to be full of strange occurrences and unsettling secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the rooms of the chalet, uncover scattered notes that reveal the story of its mysterious inhabitants, and find hidden clues to aid your progress. Solve puzzles involving switches, codes, and hidden mechanisms to unlock new areas. Throughout your journey, a dark presence lingers in the , creating moments of tension and unexpected scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With atmospheric visuals, ambient sound design, and a narrative told through the discovered notes, Chalet invites players to piece together its haunting story and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
